    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MARIA: Nelly, look-\nNELLY: Yes, there we are.\nMRS TERNAN: The print is a little small, but no matter.",
      "NELLY: The Haymarket. She is so sad not to be here.\nMRS TERNAN: But Nelly will give you a wonderful performance-",
      "MRS TERNAN: Thank you.\nMARIA: Should I stand a little wider?",
      "NELLY: Do I speak after the gun?\nMARIA: Frank!..Frank!!",
      "NELLY: This is a tale of woe. This is a tale of sorrow. A love denied. A love restored to live beyond tomorrow. Lest we think silence is the place …\nMRS TERNAN: Maybe a little louder, Nelly."
    ]
  },
